cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Weatheo climate data: ERA5 city temperature tables and municipal climate normals"
abstract: "City-level temperature tables (means, anomalies against 2011-2025, hot days, tropical nights, frost days, extremes) behind the Weatheo climate reports, derived from ERA5 via Open-Meteo; and municipal climate datasets for France (34,863 communes), Portugal (308 municipios), Luxembourg (100 communes) and Serbia (169 municipalities and cities): monthly climate normals 1991-2020 (mean temperature, precipitation) and the climate shift between 1961-1990 and 1991-2020, from Copernicus ERA5-Land monthly means (ERA5 where ERA5-Land has no value), nearest grid cell per municipality. Contains modified Copernicus Climate Change Service information 2026."
keywords:
  - climate
  - climate normals
  - climate change
  - temperature
  - precipitation
  - ERA5
  - ERA5-Land
  - Copernicus
  - municipalities
  - France
  - Portugal
  - Luxembourg
  - Serbia
